```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Ready((ready))
    Routing([routing])
    Wait[waiting_to_charge]
    Charging([charging])
    Unloading([unloading])
    Complete([complete])
    Failed([failed])

    Ready -->|"nav action / TRUCK_ROUTING"| Routing
    Routing -->|"arrival / TRUCK_READY"| Ready

    Routing -->|"charger full / FCFS gating"| Wait
    Wait -->|"port freed / wake + start"| Charging
    Wait -->|"leave queue / reroute"| Ready

    Ready -->|"charge action"| Charging
    Charging -->|"charge_complete / TRUCK_READY"| Ready

    Ready -->|"deliver action / start service"| Unloading
    Unloading -->|"service done / TRUCK_READY"| Ready

    Ready -->|"all deliveries done"| Complete
    Routing -->|"battery depletion / infeasible path"| Failed
    Ready -->|"invalid / infeasible action"| Failed
```
